            <div class="mission-text">
              <div class="max-width-40">
                <h2 heading-rebuild="" class="section-heading">Children lead the way, we follow their curiosity</h2>
              </div>
              <p to-top-2="" class="paragraph-regular mission">Since 2009 we have cared for little ones the same way: listen closely, follow each child’s pace, and build routines that feel like home. It takes patience. It is also how confident, happy learners grow.</p>
